{
	"name": "Four Nations Harmony",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Channeling the elements you know into a powerful hybrid stance, you gain the following benefits based on your chosen element:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Water:</strong> Your unarmed strike gains an additional 10ft of reach. You do not have disadvantage when striking targets within 5ft.</p></li><li><p><strong>Earth:</strong> Any creature that fails a Strength or Dexterity save against your combat maneuvers or focus features is also knocked Prone so long as you are using your unarmed strikes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fire:</strong> Your critical hit range increases by 1. If you already benefit from an increased critical range, it may not exceed 17-20 using this feature.</p></li><li><p><strong>Air:</strong> You do not provoke opportunity attacks when you dash, and you gain a +10ft movement speed and jump distance increase on high or long jumps.</p></li></ul>",
